80	     * Read-only, non-persistent count of the owners that share this owner's {@code householdId}
81	     * (including this owner), populated by the service when an owner is loaded for presentation.
82	     * Zero when the owner belongs to no household. Used to derive the membership tier.
83	     */
84	    @Transient
85	    private int householdSize;
